BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queen Kelly (1929)
DTSTART:20260510T211500Z
DTEND:20260510T231000Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T211500Z
UID:gp34uXSa0W
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nIn this glorious new restoration
  of the silent epic melodrama\, Gloria Swanson stars as Patricia Kelly\, a
  flirtatious girl who captures the eye of Prince Wolfram. Using Erich von 
 Stroheim’s shooting script\, this version ingeniously incorporates previ
 ously unseen material to recreate the film’s original dénouement. New 
 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/queen-kelly\n\nEstimated 
 start: 14:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
