BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Primavera
DTSTART:20260511T220000Z
DTEND:20260512T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260511T220000Z
UID:C0EhKfFM4G
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nInspired by Antonio Vivaldi’s 
 nearly three decades at the Ospedale della Pietà\, where orphaned girls p
 erformed from behind screens and convent walls\, this dramatic story follo
 ws Cecilia—a gifted young virtuoso who refused to be silenced. As part 
 of the introduction to the May 11 screening\, there will be a short live B
 aroque music performance courtesy of the Seattle Bach Festival. This film 
 is generously sponsored by Peggy & Dennis Willingham.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/festival/primavera\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 1 (Fri 15 M
 ay\, 6:00 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 15:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
